WEBVTT

00:00:15.115 --> 00:00:21.025
I rip my inescapable fate
to pieces and move forward

00:00:21.025 --> 00:00:26.795
accepting the unavoidable reality in my heart

00:00:26.795 --> 00:00:32.565
At the end of the sorrow and hardship

00:00:32.565 --> 00:00:37.505
my writhing soul heads towards the light

00:00:37.505 --> 00:00:43.345
I shout... I grant...

00:00:43.345 --> 00:00:50.025
And I head past the unwavering obsessions

00:00:50.025 --> 00:00:55.725
Even if just for a moment,
hold me, heart and all, in your arms

00:00:55.725 --> 00:01:00.895
So I can feel the warmth of happiness

00:01:00.895 --> 00:01:06.705
I destroy... I try...

00:01:06.705 --> 00:01:13.215
I just have to live with all my might

00:01:13.215 --> 00:01:18.885
I don't feel Ioneliness
since I left it somewhere

00:01:18.885 --> 00:01:24.025
Kindness... sympathy...
I don't need either of them now...

00:01:24.025 --> 00:01:27.785
Shine the light!

00:01:35.995 --> 00:01:36.825
"Exit"

00:01:50.805 --> 00:01:53.905
Huh?! Mount Goryo? Are you serious?

00:01:53.905 --> 00:01:58.175
But... Kagami-kun called you, right?

00:01:58.175 --> 00:02:00.415
He told you that he
was going to train there.

00:02:00.415 --> 00:02:04.785
Well, yeah. He said that he needed to
do it to become a monk or something.

00:02:04.785 --> 00:02:08.285
He sounded serious about quitting school.

00:02:08.285 --> 00:02:12.425
Hey, Kasuga.
So you were serious about Ouri?

00:02:12.425 --> 00:02:13.915
Wha... What?

00:02:14.965 --> 00:02:18.965
When Makina Hoshimura saved my life,

00:02:18.965 --> 00:02:22.475
I learned about the existence of Shikabane.

00:02:22.475 --> 00:02:28.675
Since then, I've been thinking about death.

00:02:28.675 --> 00:02:34.615
Death seems scary
and also somehow sweet...

00:02:34.615 --> 00:02:38.315
I wonder what I'm searching for...

00:02:50.235 --> 00:02:52.665
I came to rescue you... Makina...

00:02:59.545 --> 00:03:01.075
We're not gonna buy it.

00:03:01.075 --> 00:03:03.745
But they really did a good job on this one.

00:03:03.745 --> 00:03:06.875
So, what did they call for this time?

00:03:07.385 --> 00:03:11.015
They say that a Shikabane
of Keisei Tagami has appeared.

00:03:11.015 --> 00:03:12.725
Is that possible?

00:03:12.725 --> 00:03:15.395
In his case, no.

00:03:15.395 --> 00:03:18.495
He was someone
immune to such obsessions.

00:03:18.495 --> 00:03:21.825
Then we're not going, right? We have
to deal with the traitor monk, too, so...

00:03:21.825 --> 00:03:24.365
No, we're going...

00:03:24.365 --> 00:03:27.525
since it has something to do
with Makina Hoshimura's curse.

00:03:29.335 --> 00:03:35.515
Say, Sadahiro... Do you think it'd
be better if we just let Makina die?

00:03:35.515 --> 00:03:38.375
Otherwise, as things stand, Ouri will...

00:03:38.375 --> 00:03:45.715
Our job is to kill.
Let the living worry about the living.

00:03:48.025 --> 00:03:54.725
That's awful, Itsuki-chan.
If you do that, I'll really die!

00:04:06.075 --> 00:04:11.205
Tell me, Takamasa.
How am I any different from Itsuki-chan?

00:04:12.045 --> 00:04:14.385
Someone told me...

00:04:14.385 --> 00:04:17.915
Itsuki-chan died in a car
accident, too, right?

00:04:17.915 --> 00:04:19.915
Yes, that's right.

00:04:21.155 --> 00:04:25.825
It's the same! I, too, died in a car crash.

00:04:25.825 --> 00:04:27.125
I know.

00:04:27.125 --> 00:04:30.665
Then why does she get
to be a Shikabane Hime,

00:04:30.665 --> 00:04:33.305
while I'm a Shikabane
who is to be killed?!

00:04:33.305 --> 00:04:36.735
Answer me! Takamasa!

00:04:36.735 --> 00:04:39.275
You are just another Shikabane.

00:04:39.275 --> 00:04:42.075
You should've made me a Shikabane Hime...

00:04:42.075 --> 00:04:44.805
No, I guess a Shikabane Prince?

00:04:47.645 --> 00:04:52.455
We are only able to make girls within a
certain age range into Shikabane Hime.

00:04:52.455 --> 00:04:56.195
That limited technique is all that
has been passed down among us.

00:04:56.195 --> 00:04:59.365
It's not fair... It's not fair, right?!

00:04:59.365 --> 00:05:03.495
You killed people.
That's why you're being judged.

00:05:03.495 --> 00:05:08.365
You guys are killing Shikabane.
Don't you get judged for that?

00:05:09.375 --> 00:05:15.045
I couldn't forgive them...
And I bore a grudge against those in cars.

00:05:15.045 --> 00:05:20.485
I followed my feelings.
That's all. It's called nature, right?

00:05:20.485 --> 00:05:23.355
Everyone has his own nature.

00:05:23.355 --> 00:05:26.125
I just followed that nature.

00:05:26.125 --> 00:05:30.655
I'm much more human than you guys,
who live hiding your own nature.

00:05:30.655 --> 00:05:34.325
I'm right, aren't I?!
So I will cast judgment!

00:05:36.995 --> 00:05:39.535
It's presumptuous of me
to call it my nature,

00:05:39.535 --> 00:05:44.235
but I do have it... a strong
desire at the bottom of my heart...

00:05:44.235 --> 00:05:48.845
I don't know how many times I
felt that I wanted to listen to my heart.

00:05:48.845 --> 00:05:52.005
Sougi-san's desire...

00:05:53.185 --> 00:05:56.485
But I suppress it...

00:05:58.355 --> 00:06:00.655
I live hiding it.

00:06:11.265 --> 00:06:13.535
It's not just me.

00:06:13.535 --> 00:06:17.735
Everyone lives resisting their nature.

00:06:18.575 --> 00:06:21.845
That's what it means "to live."

00:06:21.845 --> 00:06:25.175
You let your nature conquer you.
You're no longer human.

00:06:25.685 --> 00:06:28.205
Itsuki, kill Tomoharu!

00:06:54.375 --> 00:06:57.075
Takamasa...

00:06:58.915 --> 00:07:04.475
Tomoharu-kun...
Let me apologize when I join you.

00:07:21.665 --> 00:07:24.935
Takamasa... How was that?

00:07:24.935 --> 00:07:28.735
Yeah... You're pretty, Itsuki...

00:07:32.845 --> 00:07:37.345
This is a Shikabane Hime, Ouri.

00:07:39.925 --> 00:07:43.295
Tomoharu has been inactive for four years.

00:07:43.295 --> 00:07:46.825
Someone instigated him...
The traitor monk?

00:07:46.825 --> 00:07:50.535
Which means the
Seven Stars are on the move...

00:07:50.535 --> 00:07:55.135
Para-para-para-para-para! Hi, pervert Ouri!

00:07:55.135 --> 00:07:56.205
Flesh...

00:07:56.205 --> 00:08:00.665
Are you hitting and touching
Itsuki's boobs this time?!

00:08:01.145 --> 00:08:03.305
Looks like things here
have been taken care of.

00:08:03.345 --> 00:08:07.615
Ouri-kun! Makina-chan has been
taken back to the head temple again!

00:08:08.015 --> 00:08:09.685
Was it because of her curse?

00:08:09.685 --> 00:08:11.355
Yeah, but...

00:08:11.355 --> 00:08:16.655
Honda left a message that a Shikabane
of Keisei appeared and went missing.

00:08:17.295 --> 00:08:20.225
I'm going back to Mount Goryo.
Please let me ride with you.

00:08:21.065 --> 00:08:22.225
Ouri!

00:08:23.995 --> 00:08:26.235
I don't know what's going on,

00:08:26.235 --> 00:08:28.565
but Makina-chan
is already a Shikabane Hime.

00:08:28.565 --> 00:08:32.005
She isn't a human. Don't forget that.

00:08:33.345 --> 00:08:37.175
I do have it... a strong
desire at the bottom of my heart...

00:08:37.175 --> 00:08:39.015
I live hiding it.

00:08:39.015 --> 00:08:42.035
Everyone lives resisting their nature...

00:08:50.925 --> 00:08:55.595
What's the matter, Makina?
Why are you running away?

00:08:55.595 --> 00:08:58.995
Makina... Come here...

00:08:59.565 --> 00:09:00.365
Mom...

00:09:00.365 --> 00:09:03.205
Ahh... I'm feeling so good...

00:09:03.205 --> 00:09:04.835
Me too...

00:09:05.335 --> 00:09:08.505
Inspectors?! This is...

00:09:08.505 --> 00:09:12.845
They're all experiencing their
greatest happiness right now.

00:09:12.845 --> 00:09:17.185
They experience their greatest
happiness and die at its peak.

00:09:17.185 --> 00:09:22.085
There's this guy who loves the power
of the pleasure people release then.

00:09:38.235 --> 00:09:41.305
Death is the greatest happiness.

00:09:41.305 --> 00:09:44.475
I wanna become happier and happier, too.

00:09:44.475 --> 00:09:48.415
Don't worry, Makina. He's not the one.

00:09:48.415 --> 00:09:51.405
I'm your opponent.

00:09:54.885 --> 00:09:56.225
What's the matter, Makina?

00:09:56.225 --> 00:09:58.425
You're not Keisei.

00:09:58.425 --> 00:10:02.565
That's not true. I'm Keisei.

00:10:02.565 --> 00:10:03.995
I'm Keisei's Shikabane.

00:10:03.995 --> 00:10:05.795
No, you're not!

00:10:07.965 --> 00:10:11.575
That's right. You can't shoot me.

00:10:11.575 --> 00:10:13.745
You're not Keisei...

00:10:13.745 --> 00:10:20.185
You wanna know why I became a
Shikabane, right... Makina Hoshimura?

00:10:20.185 --> 00:10:26.675
It's because of my regrets...
my obsessions... My desire to see you...

00:10:29.295 --> 00:10:32.425
That's right, Makina. I love you...

00:10:32.425 --> 00:10:34.485
Don't come near me!

00:10:35.835 --> 00:10:37.995
No, you're not...

00:10:45.105 --> 00:10:47.175
How beautiful...

00:10:47.175 --> 00:10:50.815
Something strong
is fragilely falling apart...

00:10:50.815 --> 00:10:53.645
It looks beautiful...

00:10:53.645 --> 00:10:58.345
You can change, too...
Makina Hoshimura...

00:11:01.325 --> 00:11:02.315
Hey...

00:11:07.165 --> 00:11:09.655
Geez, he's hopeless...

00:11:15.505 --> 00:11:16.905
Ouri...

00:11:16.905 --> 00:11:19.745
Manag... Sadahiro-san, Akira-san...

00:11:19.745 --> 00:11:22.075
Rika... If I'm not mistaken, these guys're...

00:11:27.185 --> 00:11:29.315
Why are you two here?

00:11:29.315 --> 00:11:31.585
You are Sadahiro Mibu-san, right?

00:11:31.585 --> 00:11:34.325
You and Senior Tagami became
contracted monks at the same time.

00:11:34.325 --> 00:11:37.995
But I heard that you
returned to secular life.

00:11:37.995 --> 00:11:40.255
Then keep it that way.

00:11:41.065 --> 00:11:46.005
Hoshimura-san should be around here.
And I heard a Shikabane of Brother...

00:11:46.005 --> 00:11:48.365
He'd never become a Shikabane.

00:11:48.365 --> 00:11:49.665
Really?!

00:11:51.605 --> 00:11:54.935
Ouri... Go back already...

00:11:55.775 --> 00:11:58.845
Forget about the Kougon Sect
and Makina Hoshimura.

00:11:58.845 --> 00:12:02.245
Forget about everything
and live an ordinary life.

00:12:03.115 --> 00:12:04.855
It's still not too late.

00:12:04.855 --> 00:12:07.455
Impossible! I can't forget!

00:12:07.455 --> 00:12:10.625
Even if you can't, do it, you idiot!

00:12:10.625 --> 00:12:14.455
Everyone lives on by pushing
themselves on one or two things.

00:12:15.295 --> 00:12:17.895
Push yourself hard to have
high spirits and forget it.

00:12:17.895 --> 00:12:20.365
Geez, that made no sense...

00:12:27.975 --> 00:12:31.915
Go, Ouri-kun.
I'm sure you can find Makina-chan!

00:12:32.915 --> 00:12:35.315
You're still her contracted monk, right?!

00:12:47.495 --> 00:12:50.895
Aren't you misunderstanding
something, uhm...

00:12:50.895 --> 00:12:52.805
I'm Rika Aragami.

00:12:52.805 --> 00:12:58.905
I see, you're the granddaughter
of Aragami's old lady, huh?

00:12:58.905 --> 00:13:04.315
Sojo Takamine has been concerned that some
Inspectors including Honda are taking action...

00:13:04.315 --> 00:13:07.335
under Gon-Dai-Sojo Shiou's orders.

00:13:08.185 --> 00:13:13.825
It seems that Gon-Dai-Sojo is trying to
get rid of Shikabane Hime and gain power.

00:13:13.825 --> 00:13:16.595
To do so, not for the
purpose of killing Shikabane, but...

00:13:16.595 --> 00:13:19.025
for the purpose of killing humans,
he's keeping a certain Shikabane Hime

00:13:19.025 --> 00:13:20.865
and contracted monk around secretly...

00:13:20.865 --> 00:13:23.535
You probably won't believe me,

00:13:23.535 --> 00:13:27.835
but I came here to kill the so-called
Shikabane of Keisei. That's all!

00:13:31.005 --> 00:13:33.505
Whoa! It's a balloon!

00:13:33.505 --> 00:13:34.975
Don't touch it!

00:13:34.975 --> 00:13:36.305
What?

00:13:37.645 --> 00:13:39.015
Flesh!

00:13:43.515 --> 00:13:45.815
This is one of the Seven Stars' curses.

00:13:45.815 --> 00:13:49.825
It grows by possessing humans
and collecting their happy feelings.

00:13:49.825 --> 00:13:51.955
Akira, we're getting out of here!

00:13:52.525 --> 00:13:53.615
Ah!

00:13:53.895 --> 00:13:54.985
Saki!

00:14:19.325 --> 00:14:20.385
Ouri-kun!

00:14:20.385 --> 00:14:22.855
Where are you?! Hoshimura-san!

00:14:28.265 --> 00:14:31.665
Hey, Makina!

00:14:32.535 --> 00:14:36.165
Where are you?! Come out!

00:14:36.935 --> 00:14:41.675
I'll make you... beautiful!

00:14:41.675 --> 00:14:44.345
It's not Keisei... It's not Keisei...

00:14:44.345 --> 00:14:45.445
- Makina!
- Lt's not Keisei...

00:14:45.445 --> 00:14:47.285
It's not Keisei...

00:14:47.285 --> 00:14:48.445
- Come out!
- Lt's not Keisei...

00:14:48.445 --> 00:14:50.885
It's not Keisei... It's not Keisei!

00:14:50.885 --> 00:14:55.125
Oh... so you were hiding here...

00:14:55.125 --> 00:14:56.595
Keisei!

00:14:56.595 --> 00:14:59.695
I love you, Makina.

00:14:59.695 --> 00:15:01.695
I love you.

00:15:01.695 --> 00:15:04.355
Kei... sei...

00:15:15.705 --> 00:15:21.645
You son of a bitch!
How dare you hurt... my beautiful...

00:15:21.645 --> 00:15:24.945
Don't pretend to be Brother
and talk creepy like that!

00:15:37.565 --> 00:15:39.565
Hoshimura-san...

00:15:39.565 --> 00:15:41.435
Don't hurt Keisei...

00:15:41.435 --> 00:15:43.305
What're you saying, Hoshimura-san?!

00:15:43.305 --> 00:15:46.845
Brother wouldn't talk like that
and he wouldn't try to kill you, either.

00:15:46.845 --> 00:15:50.015
He might be one of the Seven Stars
who's just pretending to be Brother!

00:15:50.015 --> 00:15:52.415
I know that!

00:15:54.945 --> 00:15:59.905
Even so, I can't... I can't...

00:16:00.655 --> 00:16:02.915
I can't do it!

00:16:18.475 --> 00:16:21.805
I can change...

00:16:22.605 --> 00:16:26.135
I will continue to grow more beautiful...

00:16:54.905 --> 00:16:58.505
Now, let's go... guys...

00:17:00.415 --> 00:17:02.745
Stand up, Hoshimura-san!

00:17:02.745 --> 00:17:06.755
You... still think that
you're my contracted monk?

00:17:06.755 --> 00:17:08.055
Yeah.

00:17:08.055 --> 00:17:14.755
I see. But can you still be my contracted
monk... even after I tell you this?

00:17:16.265 --> 00:17:18.665
When Keisei was dying,

00:17:18.665 --> 00:17:25.665
yes, when he was about to die
after being stabbed by you... he said...

00:17:26.575 --> 00:17:30.345
So... please smile...

00:17:30.345 --> 00:17:35.245
I sensed... that it was Keisei's regrets...

00:17:35.245 --> 00:17:41.385
I thought that if I didn't smile there,
it would become his obsession...

00:17:41.385 --> 00:17:46.125
and he might become a Shikabane.

00:17:47.565 --> 00:17:53.465
But I... smiled... I smiled at him.

00:17:53.465 --> 00:17:58.235
I didn't turn Keisei into
a Shikabane to let him live...

00:17:58.905 --> 00:18:02.745
The one who really killed Keisei was me!

00:18:03.715 --> 00:18:09.655
That's fine... because you
wanted to do it for him, right?

00:18:09.655 --> 00:18:13.985
You loved Brother that much.

00:18:21.095 --> 00:18:24.325
I understand it, too...

00:18:30.135 --> 00:18:31.795
Maybe...

00:18:32.905 --> 00:18:35.175
No, it's true...

00:18:36.105 --> 00:18:40.985
I love Keisei... even now for sure...

00:18:40.985 --> 00:18:44.975
That's why I couldn't
accept the contract with you.

00:18:46.825 --> 00:18:49.655
I killed Keisei...

00:18:49.655 --> 00:18:53.325
And yet I would forget about him
and have a new contracted monk...

00:18:53.325 --> 00:18:55.765
I couldn't forgive myself...

00:18:55.765 --> 00:18:57.435
You don't have to forget him.

00:18:57.435 --> 00:18:59.025
What?

00:18:59.195 --> 00:19:05.465
I was told... that people
can't live as they desire...

00:19:06.305 --> 00:19:11.265
that people live hiding their true desires.

00:19:12.015 --> 00:19:15.275
Then I'm not a human.

00:19:15.945 --> 00:19:19.545
Oh, of course... I'm a Shikabane.

00:19:21.655 --> 00:19:27.395
You can keep the bond with Brother
even while you're contracted with me.

00:19:27.395 --> 00:19:29.995
I won't tell anyone.

00:19:29.995 --> 00:19:33.025
I'll hide your heart.

00:19:44.175 --> 00:19:46.575
That's not possible.

00:19:47.745 --> 00:19:49.185
Sadahiro-san...

00:19:49.185 --> 00:19:52.555
Sadahiro?
If I'm not mistaken, he and Keisei were...

00:19:52.555 --> 00:19:54.925
Unless she breaks the bond with Keisei,

00:19:54.925 --> 00:19:57.895
the stagnated Rune will remain within her.

00:19:57.895 --> 00:20:03.395
Her regrets towards Keisei will become
a curse... and that will make you suffer.

00:20:03.395 --> 00:20:08.235
Contracting with a Shikabane Hime
with a curse is... impossible.

00:20:08.235 --> 00:20:09.835
It's not a curse.

00:20:09.835 --> 00:20:10.835
What?

00:20:10.835 --> 00:20:14.175
It's a tie between
Brother and Hoshimura-san.

00:20:14.175 --> 00:20:15.605
I won't let anyone call it a curse.

00:20:15.605 --> 00:20:17.445
Then what're you gonna do?!

00:20:17.445 --> 00:20:20.185
It's not a curse. It's power!

00:20:20.185 --> 00:20:23.515
Brother, Hoshimura-san and me...

00:20:23.515 --> 00:20:27.255
With our power put together,
we can defeat even the Seven Stars!

00:20:27.255 --> 00:20:30.185
That's how I feel.

00:20:31.695 --> 00:20:35.965
Hey, where are you?!
Makina, where are you?!

00:20:35.965 --> 00:20:37.865
You damn brat!

00:20:37.865 --> 00:20:40.305
What a terrible Keisei he is...

00:20:40.305 --> 00:20:42.965
He should be suffering from that injury!

00:20:42.965 --> 00:20:45.195
He switched bodies.

00:20:45.635 --> 00:20:49.045
His name is Ena of the Seven Stars.

00:20:49.045 --> 00:20:54.615
He has a curse that allows him to switch
from one Shikabane's body to another.

00:20:54.615 --> 00:21:00.145
By doing so, he thinks that
he's achieving a beautiful evolution.

00:21:01.655 --> 00:21:03.725
Hey, you can't take him on!

00:21:03.725 --> 00:21:07.795
I will do it! I've stabbed Brother once!

00:21:07.795 --> 00:21:09.295
But that's because you
were being manipulated.

00:21:09.295 --> 00:21:12.065
That's Ena's power, too!

00:21:12.665 --> 00:21:16.135
Even still, every time I recall it,
it makes me want to throw up.

00:21:16.135 --> 00:21:19.005
It'll be the same even if it's a
Shikabane with Brother's face.

00:21:19.005 --> 00:21:22.305
No one else has to feel that way.

00:21:22.305 --> 00:21:27.985
Hoshimura-san and Sadahiro-san don't
have to know... such a terrible feeling!

00:21:27.985 --> 00:21:33.255
Oh, really. You like this face that much?

00:21:33.255 --> 00:21:35.845
Then I'll show you more.

00:21:42.425 --> 00:21:47.095
How's this? Which Brother do you like?

00:21:54.605 --> 00:22:02.285
Dreaming of the day I reach the land of peace

00:22:02.285 --> 00:22:06.315
I've just taken a big step forward

00:22:06.315 --> 00:22:13.995
I won't look away from the reality
that seems like a shimmering illusion

00:22:13.995 --> 00:22:21.905
Even if I can't find the light anywhere

00:22:24.635 --> 00:22:30.415
"Is there a future where I'm headed?"

00:22:30.415 --> 00:22:36.345
I asked the gray sky above

00:22:36.345 --> 00:22:42.185
I can move forward only by fighting

00:22:42.185 --> 00:22:47.995
I live life ineptly, as it's the only way I know

00:22:47.995 --> 00:22:53.065
So I'm constantly struggling

00:22:53.065 --> 00:23:00.845
Dreaming of the day I reach the land of peace

00:23:00.845 --> 00:23:04.875
I've just taken a big step forward

00:23:04.875 --> 00:23:12.555
I won't look away from the reality
that seems like a shimmering illusion

00:23:12.555 --> 00:23:20.425
Even if I can't find the light anywhere

00:23:25.295 --> 00:23:30.135
In this world, there's indeed a
happiness that you can't gain

00:23:30.135 --> 00:23:32.635
unless you make someone else unhappy.

00:23:32.635 --> 00:23:35.305
Everyone is possessed...

00:23:35.305 --> 00:23:39.475
by a "monster named happiness."
